  "limitations": [
    "The study has sample specificity and constraints related to the research methodology.",
    "Spatial accessibility measurement was simplified by using a 15-minute travel distance as the radius for the spatial threshold and fixed speeds, which may not account for multi-generational users or dynamic factors (e.g., climatic conditions).",
    "Differences in measurement methods (objective vs. subjective) contributed to discrepancies in results.",
    "Future research should further investigate the combined measurement of perceptual and spatial accessibility to minimize differences."
